# Build targets

build minesweeper_Release: phony bin-int/Release/minesweeper.postbuild
build minesweeper_Debug: phony bin-int/Debug/minesweeper.postbuild

# Project phony targets

build minesweeper: phony bin/Release/minesweeper.postbuild

